Package: com.chasedavis.lowerinstall
Name: LowerInstall
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 15.0)
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Install apps meant for newer iOS by spoofing installd + App Store version checks. RootHide/rootless port of julioverne's LowerInstall for iOS 15–17.
